[6.797794, "o", "agentify: b593f5ea1 Merge PR #38: coverage: an evidence record proves a row only if its files show the row ran\r\nead686c33 Merge agentify (PRs #37, #38) into pr/gui-batch3\r\n83d5211c9 webgui parity: check_gui_parity compares each pvgui page widget's PV with the PyQt widget's\r\n13ba1ffdf webgui tests: fixes from the first final run\r\nf505412c0 webgui parity: only a QTreeWidget gets a .select row\r\n"]
[6.810612, "o", "dd944638e webgui parity: the configdb_GUI spec maps its 23 rows to their tests\r\n67b6c6bab CHANGELOG and README: the web copies of hsdPs, configdb_GUI and xpmpva, the pyqtgraph menu rows (#40)\r\n6e6e23184 webgui: web copy of xpmpva against two simxpms (an ATCA XPM with xtpg, a Kcu1500)\r\n404228e51 webgui: web copy of configdb_GUI against the config DB stand-in\r\n26c25b7ef webgui: web copy of hsdPs against simhsd, whose MONTRIG counts the phase scan triggers\r\n93be3be83 webgui plots: the Plot Options and axis menus of every pyqtgraph panel (seqplot, seq_epixhr)\r\nc1a794e29 webgui parity: pyqtgraph menu controls are rows; the walk sets each, follows a child process, drives trees and dialogs\r\n3f7cc16fc webgui procstat: refuse a .cnf whose HOST macro names another machine\r\n"]
